        text: "LOST DOG — HAVE YOU SEEN TOBY? Toby is a small brown dog. He is eight years old, and he is very friendly, but he is old and a little deaf — he doesn't hear very well. He ran away from Elm Street on Friday evening. He has got a red collar with a phone number. Toby is afraid of loud noises, so please don't chase him. If you see him, please call Sandra on 611 404 404 (day or night). There is a reward: 100 euros. Thank you for helping Toby come home!",
