        text: "Dear Paco, greetings from London! I'm writing this from a small café near the river. It's raining (of course!), so I'm wearing my new blue coat. My friend Clara is sitting next to me and planning our afternoon. This morning we are visiting the British Museum — it's free! — and this afternoon we're walking to Big Ben. In the evening, Clara's cousin is cooking dinner for us. London is expensive, but the museums are free and the parks are beautiful. I'm learning a lot of English every day. See you on Sunday! Elena",
