    ReadingText(id: "en-read-flat-advert", languageID: "en", title: "Two flats, one advert", level: "A2", topic: "home",
        text: "FLAT A — Ríos 14, 3rd floor. 65 m², two bedrooms, one bathroom. Modern kitchen, small balcony, 4th floor without lift. €790/month. Quiet street, 10 minutes from the university by bike. Perfect for students or a young couple. Flat B — Avda del Sol 3, 1st floor WITH lift. 80 m², three bedrooms, bright living room, older building but recently painted. €950/month. 5 minutes from the metro. The agency says: 'Flat A is smaller but cheaper; Flat B is more comfortable and better connected. Flat A gets more sun in the afternoon; Flat B is quieter at night. Both are available from the 1st. Visits on Saturdays, 10:00–14:00. Call 91 555 0199 for more information.'",
