    ReadingText(id: "en-read-weekend-list", languageID: "en", title: "What's on this weekend", level: "A2", topic: "free time",
        text: "CITY WEEKEND GUIDE — SATURDAY & SUNDAY. SATURDAY: Free yoga in Central Park at 9:00 (bring your own mat). Farmers' market at the old port, 8:00–14:00 — the strawberries are the best in the region! River boat tour every hour, €6. SUNDAY: Photography exhibition at the Modern Museum — free entry before 12:00. Charity run: 5 or 10 km, start at 10:30 from the Town Hall. You should register online before Saturday night. Evening open-air cinema at 21:30 — tonight's film is a classic; blankets are free, hot drinks cost €1. Rain plan: all Sunday activities move to the Cultural Centre. Have a great weekend!",
